ovy2.0 vs Scala Simple Performance Test\" . 10 Jul 2012. Archived from the original on 10 December 2012 . Retrieved 7 October 2012 . ^ \"Groovy 2.4 And Grails 3.0 To Be Last Major Releases Under Pivotal Sponsorship\" . 19 Jan 2015. ^ \"Groovy joins Apache Incubator\" . 11 Mar 2015.",
